# consumer-selftest — chainless proof of the nim_rln_consumer sandwich:
# logoscore loads the module, calls cross C++ -> nim-ffi -> Nim and back
# (ping), survive a RET_STALE_WARN tick (slowPing), and an RLN op with no
# RLN module loaded fails cleanly through the whole seam instead of hanging.
NODES=1
NEEDS_MODULES="nim_rln_consumer"
TARGETS="none"
RUNNER=bash
